## PHASE 4 — VALIDATION

### 4.1 — Diff Report

After all changes produce:

- Complete list of files MODIFIED (should be ≤ 3 existing files)
- Complete list of files CREATED (all new adapter/impl classes)
- Confirm zero changes to: DB layer, Kafka layer, platform hardgate classes

### 4.2 — Test Coverage

Write unit tests for all four scenarios:

1. Flag = false → N1Legacy path executes, C1 is never invoked
1. Flag = true → C1 path executes
1. Flag = true + C1 throws → auto-fallback to N1Legacy, no exception propagated
1. Both evaluators return identical results for a known codebase input (parity test)

### 4.3 — Final Checklist

- [ ] N1 starts up without errors with flag=false
- [ ] N1 starts up without errors with flag=true
- [ ] All existing N1 tests still pass
- [ ] All new tests pass
- [ ] No new transitive dependencies from C1 touching N1’s DB/Kafka

